# Visual concept

Before changing menu/battle look, read `concepts/ART_DIRECTION.md`.
`concepts/` is **reference-only** — do not wire `res://concepts/...` into runtime scenes; ship used art under `assets/` or feature/UI folders in `src/`.

Must match:

- **Style:** graphite pencil on notebook paper — not cyan neon
- **Theme:** `core/theme/style.tres` — cream parchment buttons/panels, ink `#2A3340` text; body font `game_font.tres` (**Nunito Bold**), titles `title_font.tres` (Rubik Doodle Shadow, MSDF off, never outline)
- **Backgrounds:** `src/ui/backgrounds/` — shared `BackgroundBase` + per-variant folders (`notebook` sketches, `classic_sky`, `notebook_sky`); battle `BackgroundHost` picks random from `variants[]`; main menu = scrolling `classic_sky/` with `paint_from_daily`; pack / level-select use `paper_page/` / `levels_pack/`; shared paper/sky files may also live in `assets/backgrounds/`
- Shared runtime files: `assets/backgrounds/`, `assets/audio/music/`, `assets/effects/`, `assets/ui/icons/` — never leave playable assets only in `concepts/`
- **Daily series card:** parchment scroll `daily/ui/daily_scroll.png` (no CTA frame); progress marks = ink stamps (`stamp_empty` + filled variants `stamp_sun` / `stamp_flower` / `stamp_cat` / `stamp_star` / `stamp_heart` by slot index), not stars
- **Achievements window:** `trophy_room_window/` — full-screen hangar bg `ui/bg_hangar_achievements.png`; clipboard stats left, valley trophies on pedestals right, extra-achievements scroll bottom-right; kit `tools/generate_achievements_ui.py`
- **Battle:** horizontal flight (plane left → right), 4 lanes, round balloons, paper HUD language

Frames (refs only): `concepts/menu_notebook_modern_v3.png`, `concepts/battle_notebook_modern_v1.png`, `concepts/post_battle_notebook_concept_v3.png`, `concepts/levels_pack_notebook_concept_v1.png`, `concepts/levels_grid_adventure_ref.png`, `concepts/achievements_notebook_concept_v1.png`.  
Pencil pack (refs / generation kit): `concepts/notebook_pencil/` (`ui_pack/`).

- **Level grid:** square cream tiles; lock glyph top-right; exam tile = purple + graduation-cap overlay; completed tiles get ink stamp top-right
